    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28470" root="عذف" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاذِفٌ</span></b>  [as act. part. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَذَفَ</span> should signify
<i>Eating:</i> but see what here follows]. Ibn-'Abbád
says, (O,) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا زِلْتُ عَاذِفًا مُنْذُ اليَوْمِ</span> means <i>I have
not tasted anything</i> [<i>to-day</i>]. (O, K.)

